  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=853034), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14491201)\n\nBeneath the sun, which burns flesh to give life, and the Nile River, which swallows the earth and carries life, the Egyptians viewed the world as divided into chaos and order. Ra, the sun god, kills chaos and establishes order upon its blood; however, the order built upon blood becomes a yoke that binds Ra himself, and the thrones of the gods following beneath that order become stained with strife and bloodshed. At the center of the order established by Ra, Maat, the goddess of order, asks him, “What is your order?”",
